@startuml HGET命令执行流程

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundCorner 10
skinparam dpi 100
skinparam arrowColor #2C3E50
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FEFECE
skinparam noteBorderColor #A80036

autonumber

title HGET命令执行流程

actor "客户端" as Client
box "src/t_hash.c" #LightBlue
    participant "hgetCommand()" as HgetCommand
    participant "addHashFieldToReply()" as AddHashFieldToReply
    participant "hashTypeGetValue()" as HashTypeGetValue
    participant "hashTypeGetFromHashTable()" as HashTypeGetFromHashTable
    participant "hashTypeGetFromListpack()" as HashTypeGetFromListpack
end box

box "src/db.c" #LightGreen
    participant "lookupKeyReadOrReply()" as LookupKeyReadOrReply
    participant "lookupKeyRead()" as LookupKeyRead
    participant "lookupKeyReadWithFlags()" as LookupKeyReadWithFlags
    participant "lookupKey()" as LookupKey
    participant "dbFindWithKeySlot()" as DbFindWithKeySlot
    participant "dbFindGenericWithKeySlot()" as DbFindGenericWithKeySlot
end box

box "src/kvstore.c" #LightYellow
    participant "kvstoreDictFind()" as KvstoreDictFind
    participant "kvstoreGetDict()" as KvstoreGetDict
end box

box "src/dict.c" #LightCoral
    participant "dictFind()" as DictFind
end box

Client -> HgetCommand: 发送HGET命令
activate HgetCommand

HgetCommand -> LookupKeyReadOrReply: 查找键(c->argv[1])
activate LookupKeyReadOrReply

LookupKeyReadOrReply -> LookupKeyRead: 查找键
activate LookupKeyRead

LookupKeyRead -> LookupKeyReadWithFlags: 使用LOOKUP_NONE标志
activate LookupKeyReadWithFlags

LookupKeyReadWithFlags -> LookupKey: 查找键
activate LookupKey

note right of LookupKey
  计算键的哈希槽
  key_slot = getKeySlot(key->ptr)
end note

LookupKey -> DbFindWithKeySlot: 在数据库中查找键(key->ptr, key_slot)
activate DbFindWithKeySlot

DbFindWithKeySlot -> DbFindGenericWithKeySlot: 在kvstore中查找键
activate DbFindGenericWithKeySlot

DbFindGenericWithKeySlot -> KvstoreDictFind: 在kvstore中查找键(keySlot, key)
activate KvstoreDictFind

KvstoreDictFind -> KvstoreGetDict: 获取字典(didx)
activate KvstoreGetDict

KvstoreGetDict --> KvstoreDictFind: 返回字典对象
deactivate KvstoreGetDict

KvstoreDictFind -> DictFind: 在字典中查找键(d, key)
activate DictFind

note right of DictFind
  1. 计算键的哈希值
  2. 在哈希表中查找键
  3. 返回dictEntry或NULL
end note

DictFind --> KvstoreDictFind: 返回dictEntry
deactivate DictFind

KvstoreDictFind --> DbFindGenericWithKeySlot: 返回dictEntry
deactivate KvstoreDictFind

DbFindGenericWithKeySlot --> DbFindWithKeySlot: 返回dictEntry
deactivate DbFindGenericWithKeySlot

DbFindWithKeySlot --> LookupKey: 返回dictEntry
deactivate DbFindWithKeySlot

note right of LookupKey
  1. 检查键是否过期
  2. 更新访问时间(LRU/LFU)
  3. 更新命中/未命中统计
end note

LookupKey --> LookupKeyReadWithFlags: 返回值对象或NULL
deactivate LookupKey

LookupKeyReadWithFlags --> LookupKeyRead: 返回值对象或NULL
deactivate LookupKeyReadWithFlags

LookupKeyRead --> LookupKeyReadOrReply: 返回值对象或NULL
deactivate LookupKeyRead

alt 键不存在
    LookupKeyReadOrReply -> Client: 返回NULL
else 键存在
    LookupKeyReadOrReply --> HgetCommand: 返回哈希对象
end
deactivate LookupKeyReadOrReply

alt 键不存在或类型不是哈希
    HgetCommand -> Client: 返回错误或NULL
else 键存在且类型是哈希
    HgetCommand -> AddHashFieldToReply: 获取哈希字段值(o, c->argv[2]->ptr)
    activate AddHashFieldToReply

    AddHashFieldToReply -> HashTypeGetValue: 获取字段值
    activate HashTypeGetValue

    alt 哈希使用listpack编码
        HashTypeGetValue -> HashTypeGetFromListpack: 从listpack获取字段值
        activate HashTypeGetFromListpack

        note right of HashTypeGetFromListpack
          1. 在listpack中查找字段
          2. 获取字段对应的值
          3. 检查字段是否过期
        end note

        HashTypeGetFromListpack --> HashTypeGetValue: 返回结果
        deactivate HashTypeGetFromListpack
    else 哈希使用哈希表编码
        HashTypeGetValue -> HashTypeGetFromHashTable: 从哈希表获取字段值
        activate HashTypeGetFromHashTable

        note right of HashTypeGetFromHashTable
          1. 在哈希表中查找字段
          2. 获取字段对应的值
          3. 检查字段是否过期
        end note

        HashTypeGetFromHashTable --> HashTypeGetValue: 返回结果
        deactivate HashTypeGetFromHashTable
    end

    alt 字段过期
        HashTypeGetValue -> HashTypeGetValue: 处理过期字段
        note right
          1. 如果是主节点，删除过期字段
          2. 如果是从节点，返回过期标记
        end note
    end

    HashTypeGetValue --> AddHashFieldToReply: 返回字段值或过期标记
    deactivate HashTypeGetValue

    alt 字段存在且未过期
        AddHashFieldToReply -> Client: 返回字段值
    else 字段不存在或已过期
        AddHashFieldToReply -> Client: 返回NULL
    end

    deactivate AddHashFieldToReply
end

HgetCommand --> Client: 完成命令处理
deactivate HgetCommand

@enduml
